1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 1=

15
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:25,860
(Tian Yuyuan, Wife of the Marquis's Heir)

16
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:30,320
My Lord.

17
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:32,220
(Lin Shutiao, Third Madam of Marquis's Manor)
Dear,

18
00:01:32,790 --> 00:01:33,790
you're here.

19
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,420
- Shutiao.
- Yuyuan.

20
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,940
- What are you doing here?
- What are you doing here?

21
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:51,560
First Madam,

22
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,120
over there.

23
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,280
What are you doing?

24
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:54,760
All of you,

25
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,790
get moving.

26
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,400
If you ruin Madam's important plans,

27
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:58,510
you'll be sorry.

28
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,286
(Shen Wanwan)
Are you certain?

29
00:01:59,286 --> 00:01:59,880
(Adopted Daughter of the Marquis's Family)
Are you certain?

30
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:00,416
(Qin Xiang)
New wives of second and third young masters

31
00:02:00,416 --> 00:02:01,200
(First Madam of the Marquis's Manor)
New wives of second and third young masters

32
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,320
(Xiangchun, First Madam's Confidante)
are really having affairs with other men?

33
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,400
Yes.

34
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,560
Rest assured, First Madam.

35
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,630
I've made all the arrangements.

36
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,190
Just lead everyone inside in a moment

37
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,280
and have those two shameless women

38
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,120
beaten to death.

39
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:15,120
Hurry up.

40
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,120
Follow me

41
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:18,960
and catch

42
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:19,980
them in the act.

43
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:22,220
Get away from me.

44
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:23,210
- Who are you?
- Get away.

45
00:02:23,210 --> 00:02:24,030
Who am I?

46
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,680
Shameless women.

47
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,080
On your wedding night,

48
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,430
instead of staying
in your bridal chambers,

49
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,000
you dare come to this pleasure boat

50
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,850
to meet another man in secret.

51
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,400
Have you no regard
for the Marquis's family's reputation?

52
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:46,940
Xiang,

53
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,310
I didn't do anything.

54
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:51,200
I fainted as soon
as I entered the bridal chamber.

55
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,400
I...

56
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,280
I've never even seen this man before.

57
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,120
Someone...

58
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:57,400
Someone must have

59
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,520
deliberately set us up.

60
00:02:58,590 --> 00:03:00,120
You've been caught
in bed with other men,

61
00:03:00,390 --> 00:03:02,080
yet you still dare make excuses?

62
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:04,520
Why not admit your mistakes to Xiang?

63
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:06,190
Perhaps she'll show you some mercy.

64
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:08,360
Mercy?

65
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,640
It's too late for that.

66
00:03:11,780 --> 00:03:12,920
Cheng, He,

67
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,000
what do you think?

68
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,710
How should we deal with them?

69
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,070
New wives of the Marquis's family,

70
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,240
Tian Yuyuan

71
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,710
and Lin Shutiao,

72
00:03:31,870 --> 00:03:33,150
have violated the rules of propriety

73
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,360
and disgraced the family.

74
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,750
They shall be executed on the spot

75
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:38,570
to uphold the family rules.

76
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:26,830
My Lady.

77
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,000
My Lady.

78
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,510
Don't wake me up for my morning class.

79
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:33,120
Remember to mark me present.

80
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:33,920
My Lady,

81
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,600
now that you're awake,

82
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,170
why don't we

83
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,390
have some fun together?

84
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:43,950
Who are you?

85
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:47,600
Have you no shame?

86
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,310
Oh my goodness!

87
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,510
A white jade ruyi.

88
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,830
(Celadon Glazed Jade Vase.)

89
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:56,040
(Rosewood Harp with Skylark Patterns.)

90
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,270
(Crimson Lotus Scroll Table Screen.)

91
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,750
(Mountains and Waterfalls.)

92
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:00,360
Oh my.

93
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,190
They're all genuine.

94
00:05:06,790 --> 00:05:08,270
Am I dreaming?

95
00:05:12,820 --> 00:05:14,420
Did my alarm go off?

96
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:17,870
I still have several surgeries today.

97
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,280
Bestie?

98
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,390
What are you doing here?

99
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:29,160
Why are you dressed like that?

100
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:30,720
I must be hallucinating

101
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,070
from staying up too late.

102
00:05:32,070 --> 00:05:33,990
Let me sleep a little longer.

103
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:35,620
(On the day of the wedding,)

104
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:37,340
(both brides
of the Marquis's family vanished.)

105
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,280
(When First Madam arrived
with the servants,)

106
00:05:39,430 --> 00:05:40,760
(the two brides were found aboard
a pleasure boat,)

107
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,360
(sharing a bed with a strange man.)

108
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:43,420
(Before either could explain,)

109
00:05:43,540 --> 00:05:44,860
(the heir's silver spear
came flying through the air,)

110
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:47,000
(piercing all three
as they knelt on the floor.)

111
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:50,700
This isn't a hallucination.

112
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:54,980
I think we've

113
00:05:55,370 --> 00:05:56,860
ended up inside the novel

114
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,700
I read last night.

115
00:05:59,740 --> 00:06:00,410
Inside a novel?

116
00:06:01,130 --> 00:06:01,960
So, who are we?

117
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:06,260
We are the cannon-fodder female characters

118
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:08,700
who get framed for having an affair

119
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:11,040
on a pleasure boat right at the start,

120
00:06:11,220 --> 00:06:12,930
only to be stabbed full of holes

121
00:06:12,930 --> 00:06:14,100
by the male lead

122
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:16,960
like candied hawthorn

123
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:18,020
skewers.

124
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:21,100
What nightmare opening is this?

125
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:27,340
No, hold...

126
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:28,490
Hold on.

127
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:29,820
A pleasure boat?

128
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,710
An affair?

129
00:06:33,100 --> 00:06:33,780
That means

130
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:35,860
what happens next is...

131
00:06:35,860 --> 00:06:36,500
Hurry up!

132
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:37,980
Don't let those two
shameless women escape.

133
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:44,700
They're about to catch us in the act.

134
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:46,580
If I were you,

135
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:48,790
I'd use these two white silk sashes

136
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:50,100
to end my own life.

137
00:06:51,020 --> 00:06:51,780
So you'll at least earn

138
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:53,560
a chastity memorial arch.

139
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:56,660
First Madam,

140
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:58,060
they're in here.

141
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:05,820
That actually makes sense.

142
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:06,700
It's our only choice.

143
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:19,180
Get down there.

144
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:23,460
We don't need a chastity memorial arch.

145
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,490
Save it for your own memorial tablet.

146
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:30,310
What are you doing?

147
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:33,140
Launching our first strike against
the household scheming in this novel.

148
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:35,620
Let's take a gamble.

149
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:37,640
Same as always.

150
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:38,720
You lead the charge.

151
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,550
I'll follow right behind.

152
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:45,700
Guards.

153
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,580
Break down the door.

154
00:07:47,700 --> 00:07:48,180
Break it down!

155
00:07:56,340 --> 00:07:56,980
Where are they?

156
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,280
Where did they go?

157
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:06,170
Xiang,

158
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,430
what's that over there?

159
00:08:18,380 --> 00:08:21,020
Run!

160
00:08:32,340 --> 00:08:32,900
Tian Yuyuan,

161
00:08:33,020 --> 00:08:33,660
and Lin Shutiao,

162
00:08:33,780 --> 00:08:35,120
I'll make you pay for this!

163
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:41,520
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

164
00:08:42,490 --> 00:08:46,290
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

165
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,050
Bestie,

166
00:08:49,140 --> 00:08:51,370
we barely escaped with our lives.

167
00:08:51,570 --> 00:08:53,220
Isn't this

168
00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:56,290
a little too relaxing?

169
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:59,240
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

170
00:08:59,530 --> 00:09:01,660
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

171
00:09:03,220 --> 00:09:03,590
By the way,

172
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,840
haven't you read this novel?

173
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,500
What happens next?

174
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:13,900
I only read the beginning.

175
00:09:14,340 --> 00:09:15,230
Anyway,

176
00:09:16,110 --> 00:09:17,940
I'm married to the Marquis's heir,

177
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:18,650
Shen Cheng.

178
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:20,670
Oh.

179
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,100
What's with that reaction?

180
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:24,760
He

181
00:09:25,390 --> 00:09:27,240
is a ruthless, calculating,

182
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:29,780
and merciless

183
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,230
monster.

184
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:35,660
Spare us, Your Lordship.

185
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:36,620
- Spare us, Your Lordship.
- Spare us, Your Lordship.

186
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:37,540
Please spare us, Your Lordship.

187
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:38,300
I'll never do it again.

188
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,060
Never again.

189
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:39,540
Never again.

190
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:40,700
- Please let us go.
- We'll never do it again.

191
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:41,660
Please let us go.

192
00:09:41,660 --> 00:09:43,140
We promise we'll never do it again.

193
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:45,940
(Shen Cheng, Heir of the Marquis)
Please have mercy on us.

194
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:48,780
Abducting and selling children

195
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,660
is a crime tantamount to treason.

196
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:52,590
By rights,

197
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:53,890
you should be executed immediately.

198
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:55,420
But you're lucky.

199
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:58,060
I never kill the elderly

200
00:09:58,660 --> 00:09:59,500
or women.

201
00:10:10,260 --> 00:10:10,900
Unfortunately,

202
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:12,440
you're not a woman.

203
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:13,620
And you

204
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:15,670
are no elderly man.

205
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:20,650
He's that terrifying?

206
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:23,940
From now on,

207
00:10:23,940 --> 00:10:25,140
just stick with me.

208
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,060
You're not much better off.

209
00:10:27,340 --> 00:10:28,720
You're my sister-in-law,

210
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:30,820
married to the Marquis's third son,

211
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,460
the most notorious

212
00:10:33,630 --> 00:10:34,590
playboy in the capital,

213
00:10:34,890 --> 00:10:36,420
Shen He.

214
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:42,300
Say that again.

215
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:43,660
(Shen He, Third Young Master
of the Marquis's Family)

216
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,220
How much do you want?

217
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:45,780
Three...

218
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:46,420
Three hundred taels.

219
00:10:47,060 --> 00:10:47,500
You...

220
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:50,580
You kidnapped me

221
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:52,940
and only want 300 taels?

222
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:54,260
Are you looking down on me?

223
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:55,820
How am I supposed

224
00:10:55,820 --> 00:10:57,850
to face my fellow playboys now?

225
00:10:58,140 --> 00:10:59,060
How am I supposed to face them?

226
00:10:59,620 --> 00:11:00,060
Come

227
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:01,420
beat him up!

228
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,260
Forget being a rich playboy.

229
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:22,580
He's just a fool.

230
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:25,320
What are we going to do now?

231
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,990
Fight our way through household schemes

232
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:28,030
and survive until the final chapter?

233
00:11:29,140 --> 00:11:30,640
Hard work doesn't guarantee success,

234
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:32,270
but doing nothing

235
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:36,290
certainly feels great.

236
00:11:37,860 --> 00:11:38,580
Besides,

237
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,430
minor characters like us

238
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:42,580
are bound to face more trouble
even if we survive this time.

239
00:11:43,260 --> 00:11:44,620
Every good day we have

240
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:45,860
is one less day

241
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:47,410
we can enjoy.

242
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:48,480
But

243
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:49,980
I've already made a plan.

244
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:53,250
Before the original heroines return,

245
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:55,450
our main goals are to

246
00:11:55,820 --> 00:11:56,440
stay out of trouble,

247
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:57,850
make money,

248
00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:00,320
and then leave
the manor with our savings.

249
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:00,940
We'll open shops.

250
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:01,940
We'll buy houses.

251
00:12:01,940 --> 00:12:02,740
And we have some fun.

252
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:07,980
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

253
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,720
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

254
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:18,920
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

255
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:24,120
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

256
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:30,360
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

257
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:36,820
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

258
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:43,280
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

259
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:47,950
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

260
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:10,050
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
